  title = {Using a {{Multivariate Multilevel Polytomous Item Response Theory Model}} to {{Study Parallel Processes}} of {{Change}}: {{The Dynamic Association Between Adolescents}}' {{Social Isolation}} and {{Engagement With Delinquent Peers}} in the {{National Youth Survey}}},
  shorttitle = {Using a {{Multivariate Multilevel Polytomous Item Response Theory Model}} to {{Study Parallel Processes}} of {{Change}}},
  author = {Hsieh, Chueh-An and family=Eye, given=Alexander A., prefix=von, useprefix=true and Maier, Kimberly S.},
  date = {2010-05-28},
  journaltitle = {Multivariate Behavioral Research},
  volume = {45},
